  "notes": "Each quotation has its own visual subject. Apollo bootprint is used only for Veni vidi vici; the MDN flower only for Carpe diem. NASA Earth remains only under the LATIN opening and ending. Other scenes mix original 3D illustration, genuine nature footage and an interpretive NASA Tycho data visualization. All thirteen Latin quotes, translations and authors remain exactly unchanged.",
